__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
build/
install/
log/
# Generated validation artifacts (report + plots). A leading "test/output/" has an
# embedded slash, so git anchors it to the repo root and it never matched the real
# path, herding_controller/test/output/. "**/" makes it match at any depth.
**/test/output/
# 실험 스크립트가 생성하는 중간 데이터 (완성된 *_replay.html에 이미 끼워 넣어져 있어 중복).
herding_controller/experiments/*_frames.json
